  "title": "Taweez for Chest Pains",
  "data": "It is reported that the following verse from [Surah al-Baqarah](A6) (2:72) may be recited by those who suffer from chest pains:\nوَ اِذْ قَتَلْتُمْ نَفْسًا فَادّٰرَءْتُمْ فِيْهَا وَ اللّٰهُ مُخْرِجٌ مَّا كُنْتُمْ تَكْتُمُوْنَ\nWA IDH QATALTUM NAFSAN FADDAARA'TUM FEEHAA, WALLAAHU MUKHRIJUM MAA KUNTUM TAKTUMOON\nAnd remember when you slew a man and disputed over it, but Allah was to bring forth that which you were hiding.\nA tradition reads: Seek healing from the Holy Qur'an, for Almighty Allah says: 'O men! There has come to you indeed an admonition from your Lord and a healing for what is in the breasts' (10:57)."
}
